---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms & Sponsorship | Top Realtors Cypress TX"
  description="Publisher relationship, editorial scope and use of this Cypress directory."
  path="/terms.html"
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap legal">
    <span class="eyebrow">About this directory</span>
    <h1>Terms &amp; sponsorship</h1>
    <h2>Publisher relationship</h2>
    <p>
      The publisher provides marketing services to The Lippincott Team and is
      paid by the team to create this site. Its first placement is labeled
      Sponsored listing.
    </p>
    <h2>Editorial information</h2>
    <p>
      Profiles summarize linked public sources. Ratings are snapshots of the
      named platform’s client surveys, not a score calculated by this site. No
      visitor reviews are accepted.
    </p>
    <h2>Your conversations</h2>
    <p>
      Contact professionals through their public websites or business phone
      numbers. This directory does not represent you, accept inquiries on their
      behalf, or set their fees. Confirm licensing, services and representation
      terms directly.
    </p>
    <h2>Corrections and changes</h2>
    <p>
      Sources and affiliations can change. Check the source links and dates
      before relying on a statement.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
